    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>NOTE: This plugin is for Rav Messer users only.</strong></p>\n<p>The Ravpage plugin allows Rav Messer users to seamlessly publish and display landing pages created in Rav Messer under their own WordPress domain.<br />\nInstead of sending visitors to a separate domain, your landing pages appear at URLs on your own WordPress site — fully managed from your Rav Messer account.</p>\n<p>Once the plugin is installed and connected to your Rav Messer account, any landing page you publish from Rav Messer can be assigned to a URL on your WordPress site.</p>\n<p>The connection between the WordPress plugin and your Rav Messer account is secured with a unique key generated per WordPress installation.</p>\n<p>Our support team is always happy to assist with any inquiry:<br />\n<a href=\"mailto:support@responder.co.il\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">support@responder.co.il</a> | <a href=\"https://wa.me/97237177777\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">03-717-7777</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install the Ravpage plugin using the WordPress built-in Plugin installer &gt; Add New, or upload the plugin files manually to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/ravpage</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Settings &gt; Ravpage</strong> in your WordPress admin panel.</li>\n<li>Copy the security key displayed on the settings page.</li>\n<li>Log in to your Rav Messer account and paste the key into the WordPress integration settings.</li>\n<li>Publish a landing page from Rav Messer and assign it to a URL on your WordPress site.</li>\n<li>The page will now be served from your WordPress domain automatically.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.responder.co.il/portal/he/kb/articles/%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A1%D7%95%D7%9D-%D7%93%D7%A4%D7%99-%D7%A0%D7%97%D7%99%D7%AA%D7%94-%D7%A2%D7%9D-%D7%93%D7%95%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%99%D7%9F-%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%98%D7%99-%D7%A8%D7%90%D7%A9%D7%99-%D7%91%D7%90\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Full setup guide</a> | <a href=\"https://www.responder.co.il/%D7%AA%D7%A0%D7%90%D7%99-%D7%A9%D7%99%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%A9/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Service</a> | <a href=\"https://www.responder.co.il/%D7%9E%D7%93%D7%99%D7%A0%D7%99%D7%95%D7%AA-%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%98%D7%99%D7%95%D7%AA/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.41</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update &#8211; WP version 6.9 support</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.33</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update &#8211; WP version 6.7 support</li>\n<li>Update &#8211; Libraries updated</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.20</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.19</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.18</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed security vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.15</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix &#8211; Fixed the on-load message bug</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First version</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Publish landing pages created in Rav Messer directly on your WordPress site.",
    "description": "<p><strong>NOTE: This plugin is for Rav Messer users only.</strong></p>\n<p>The Ravpage plugin allows Rav Messer users to seamlessly publish and display landing pages created in Rav Messer under their own WordPress domain.<br />\nInstead of sending visitors to a separate domain, your landing pages appear at URLs on your own WordPress site — fully managed from your Rav Messer account.</p>\n<p>Once the plugin is installed and connected to your Rav Messer account, any landing page you publish from Rav Messer can be assigned to a URL on your WordPress site.</p>\n<p>The connection between the WordPress plugin and your Rav Messer account is secured with a unique key generated per WordPress installation.</p>\n<p>Our support team is always happy to assist with any inquiry:<br />\n<a href=\"mailto:support@responder.co.il\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">support@responder.co.il</a> | <a href=\"https://wa.me/97237177777\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">03-717-7777</a></p>\n",
